{"summary":"Enjoy fun kids games for boys and girls - solve puzzles and help cars in trouble","description":"Join Dr McWheelie on her amazing adventure!\n \nDoes your kid enjoy playing with cars and overcoming obstacles? Then you should try our fun car games for kids in form of logic puzzles!\n \nGo on adventures, overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and help cars in trouble!\n \nThere are 55 levels your child can complete with Dr McWheelie, each with puzzles training logic, attention, and the basics of counting.\n \nDr McWheelie is an exciting, fun, and dynamic game for children of any age, even toddlers (with some help hints from adults)! Together with Dr McWheelie, plunge into a world filled with puzzles and unexpected turns.\n \nThis game will help children develop fine motor skills and learn traffic safety rules.\n \nWe recommend going through the exciting levels of the game with your kids. By playing together, kids develop their logic and reflexes while also studying colors and geometric shapes. Hints never hurt!\n \nThe amazing adventure begins now!\n \nIf you have questions or suggestions, you can always contact us via email at appsupport@projectfirst.ru. We love reading your messages :)","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $2.49 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MTcQIrjmm08?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zILcir1dk4bizz8R16z4sqFWl4DSgSMFMmcUMhDzM-ChMrzMncrHLhkOcLvdktTMxh6myVp7YbOmqZ-B4TAkvQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1bZMkgOIaLw4BZEJLP3pqMFAbJXLGe4CIwxVzLur7ggJXmBlxTHuaKKkzbkil3YP1ab1qVs3RpMdhSMnwVjoYw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9O4KHVsZL60UO7cYSs75Z_Vu36uzUkHGgEQ0g9f8ffmJ8q13LoMQdRM8Sg82JlNTmIyyTljlUFyjeYMCyLD0u6Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fb1fB_5hdOWOZCCmaLtv4Mu_ycm5EcNsStBExHXw5IEps47pTGVGkpgFSnK_nsCOWL2AO1V83cbhMtqezrjH","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vx9fWkwSqKmfEr_DU89uh2stE_ZHUz0oe_2Wk6Xzs7Rz0PhVI-pV72F2